Description: Lightweight CPU/RAM/GPU stats app for the Ubuntu tray
 resmon-lite shows CPU percent, RAM used/total, and per-GPU utilisation,
 VRAM, power draw and temperature in the system tray, colour-coded as
 values climb. A "Pin to screen" tray option opens the same stats as a
 small always-on-top, translucent panel you can leave on the desktop.
 .
 Supports AMD GPUs out of the box via the amdgpu driver. NVIDIA GPU
 support needs the optional nvidia-ml-py Python package, which is not
 packaged for Debian/Ubuntu; install it separately with pip if you have
 an NVIDIA GPU (see the README in /usr/share/doc/resmon-lite/).
